## Context

Child of tracker 1552 (validation corpus and blinding guards in its body).
Runs `/replicate assess` on the development split; the held-out benchmark
is 1554. Writing output under `replicator/replications/` needs a session
assigned to replicator; the summary lands here in `design/` by a harness
merge request.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] `assess` run blind (paper and package only, no I4R report) on about 10
      I4R papers from replicator's `replication_results` table, at least one
      published after the model's training cutoff.
- [ ] Each paper's six-row table compared row by row with I4R's; agreement
      and each disagreement with its cause recorded in
      `design/replicate-assess-validation-<date>.md`.
- [ ] Papers used are listed so 1554 can keep its split disjoint.
